00:37:44.533 --> 00:37:45.233
Lepaskan.

00:37:45.600 --> 00:37:48.200
Jangan melakukan hal buruk ya.

00:37:48.633 --> 00:37:49.633
Pak Nomura.

00:38:06.033 --> 00:38:07.166
[00:00:01.234... > 00:00:02.567] Kitaoka,

